{"step_index":385,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-30T16:47:47Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-30T22:17:47+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-30T22:17:47+05:30\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\efc75235-355e-455c-b598-1a3e644f6697\\prompt_draft.md. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -85,6 +85,17 @@\n - Algorithm-friendly format (kids = high watch time = algorithm love)\n - Trending meme integration = built-in discoverability\n \n+### R5. Who IS Actually Doing This — And How?\n+\n+Find real evidence of creators who ARE entering or succeeding in this niche right now:\n+- Search for tutorials, guides, or Reddit/forum posts from people who make GTA Spider-Man kids content\n+- How do they actually produce the videos? (mods used, recording software, editing workflow)\n+- How long does it take per video?\n+- Are there communities/Discord servers where these creators share knowledge?\n+- What's the success rate — for every MARINARA making $74K, how many Nemos make $0?\n+- Are there any YouTube gurus or courses that DO teach this niche? If yes, document them. If no, that itself is a finding.\n+- Find social media posts (Reddit, Twitter/X, YouTube comments) from people discussing this niche's earning potential\n+\n ## Anti-Sycophancy Enforcement\n \n Apply these rules throughout the research:\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
